        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BRK004HMRSAL, Hammered Boulder Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Large 4 Inch Square Boulder Knob Pull is designed as a dummy only. It is used as a door pull or as a door decoration. It may also be used on large furniture such as armoires or cabinets. It has a hammered insert that gives it a modern look. This Hammered Boulder Door Knob can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis style of Hammered Boulder Door Knob were made popular in Europe, where they were often placed in the center of doors as a pull. It is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International who are famous for high quality innovational door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Boulder Series Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BLD03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262334\"><b>First Impressions BRK004HMRSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Boulder Knob Pull",
                "description": "This Large 4 Inch Square Boulder Knob Pull is designed as a dummy only. It is used as a door pull or as a door decoration. It may also be used on large furniture such as armoires or cabinets. It has a hammered insert that gives it a modern look. This Hammered Boulder Door Knob can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from a huge selection of finishes.",
